WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.744 --> 00:00:16.976
"Grr!" struggled in the chocolate syrup.

2
00:00:17.896 --> 00:00:19.037
It was thick and heavy.

3
00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:21.800
Slowly she stood up.

4
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.421
Then she spun around.

5
00:00:23.441 --> 00:00:27.704
She spun faster and faster, like a tornado.

6
00:00:28.885 --> 00:00:32.008
Drops of syrup flew off of her and splattered all over.

7
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:34.601
Soon Roxy was clean.

8
00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:36.421
She looked around.

9
00:00:36.441 --> 00:00:38.302
"Where's Le Sweet?"

10
00:00:39.443 --> 00:00:40.523
Roxy flew out a window.

11
00:00:40.543 --> 00:00:42.524
"There he is!"

12
00:00:43.604 --> 00:00:46.186
Le Sweet was driving a delivery truck on the road below.

13
00:00:47.066 --> 00:00:48.607
The truck was zooming toward the city.

14
00:00:49.787 --> 00:00:51.628
A different delivery truck lay on its side.

15
00:00:52.828 --> 00:00:54.249
Roxy flew to the second truck.

16
00:00:54.889 --> 00:00:56.190
The driver stood next to it.

17
00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:57.470
"What happened?"

18
00:00:57.811 --> 00:00:58.551
Roxy asked.

19
00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:00.972
The driver threw his hands in the air.

20
00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:03.410
"Le Sweet ran me off the road!

21
00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.232
Then he stole my delivery route.

22
00:01:07.153 --> 00:01:09.975
He said I'd never deliver my whole-grain cookies again.

23
00:01:11.156 --> 00:01:14.278
From now on, people are only eating Le Sweet donuts.

24
00:01:15.039 --> 00:01:16.380
The man is crazy!"

25
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.762
"Where was your next delivery?"

26
00:01:19.062 --> 00:01:19.723
Roxy asked.

27
00:01:19.743 --> 00:01:23.166
"Metro City Elementary School," the man said.

28
00:01:24.006 --> 00:01:24.787
Roxy gulped.

29
00:01:25.928 --> 00:01:28.470
"We need to go there right now—fast!"

30
00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:30.912
She grabbed the driver with one hand.

31
00:01:31.892 --> 00:01:33.373
She grabbed the truck with the other hand.

32
00:01:34.154 --> 00:01:36.496
Zoom! Roxy shot through the sky!

33
00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:39.958
The driver smiled.

34
00:01:39.978 --> 00:01:44.042
"Wow!" As she flew over the city, Roxy looked down.

35
00:01:45.082 --> 00:01:46.704
She saw the Mighty Man actor.

36
00:01:47.384 --> 00:01:49.006
He was taking a selfie with someone.

37
00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:51.547
"Whew," Roxy thought.

38
00:01:51.568 --> 00:01:53.369
"He looks fine now.

39
00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.931
People don't stay zombies forever!"

40
00:01:59.048 --> 00:02:01.729
As the kids ate lunch in the cafeteria, a man walked in.

41
00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:05.311
He carried a stack of boxes.

42
00:02:05.331 --> 00:02:09.533
"My name is Pete Le Sweet," he said.

43
00:02:09.553 --> 00:02:12.494
"I have free donuts for everyone!"

44
00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.376
Everyone clapped and cheered.

45
00:02:17.356 --> 00:02:18.596
Le Sweet held up a donut.

46
00:02:18.617 --> 00:02:20.757
"Who wants the first one?"

47
00:02:20.777 --> 00:02:23.999
"Me!" Jack ran over.

48
00:02:24.999 --> 00:02:26.520
Le Sweet handed him the donut.

49
00:02:27.408 --> 00:02:29.630
Suddenly the cafeteria doors flew open.

50
00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:31.691
"Don't eat that!"

51
00:02:32.031 --> 00:02:32.752
Roxy shouted.

52
00:02:33.332 --> 00:02:34.093
Jack jumped.

53
00:02:34.733 --> 00:02:36.134
The donut flew out of his hand.

54
00:02:37.095 --> 00:02:40.557
It went up in the air and landed right in Le Sweet's mouth!

55
00:02:40.577 --> 00:02:44.240
"Gulp! Grargh!"

56
00:02:48.263 --> 00:02:49.544
Detective Smith rushed in.

57
00:02:50.524 --> 00:02:51.365
Roxy smiled.

58
00:02:51.385 --> 00:02:55.128
"You can take this zombie to jail, Detective!"

59
00:02:56.352 --> 00:02:57.693
The driver stepped forward.

60
00:02:57.713 --> 00:02:59.954
"Who wants cookies?"

61
00:03:01.915 --> 00:03:02.715
Everyone cheered.

62
00:03:06.297 --> 00:03:07.877
"You missed Rocket Girl!"

63
00:03:08.177 --> 00:03:09.738
Mara said to Roxy during recess.

64
00:03:09.758 --> 00:03:12.799
"Oh, that's too bad," Roxy said.

65
00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:15.400
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

66
00:03:16.421 --> 00:03:18.422
"You always miss Rocket Girl.

67
00:03:19.042 --> 00:03:20.242
I wonder why."

68
00:03:20.262 --> 00:03:23.644
"Uh Roxy didn't know what to say.

69
00:03:24.576 --> 00:03:25.978
"You missed something else too!"

70
00:03:26.218 --> 00:03:27.159
Jack said suddenly.

71
00:03:27.179 --> 00:03:30.882
"A weird guy ate a donut and turned into a zombie!"

72
00:03:31.703 --> 00:03:32.424
Roxy laughed.

73
00:03:33.665 --> 00:03:36.248
But Terrell still had that suspicious look on his face.
